# Harness

Every session:

1. **`harness_get_context`** — read agents, constraints, features from snapshot
2. **State which harness agent role you are acting as**
3. **End:** **`harness_handoff`** (clean — no active features)

Agent instructions live in `.harness/agents/` — do not duplicate here.

Route by user intent:

| Intent | Role |
|--------|------|
| plan, design spec, brainstorm | **planner** |
| implement, code, fix | **coder** |
| review, check PR | **reviewer** |
| architecture, trade-off, should we use X | **architect** |

When acting in a role, read `.harness/agents/<role>.md` before working.
